      "en": "The Ephraimites assembled[NOTE:1] and crossed over to Zaphon. They said to Jephthah, “Why did you go and fight[NOTE:2] with the Ammonites without asking[NOTE:3] us to go with you? We will burn your house down right over you!”[NOTE:4]",
